<title>USA: Datakey gets $1.39 mln contract with XATA.</title>
<headline>Datakey gets $1.39 mln contract with XATA.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datakey Inc said Monday it received a contract valued at $1.39 million to provide XATA Corp with electronic memory keys.</p>
<p>XATA provides an onboard information system for the fleet trucking industry. The onboard computer records trip data such as mileage, fuel usage, loading and unloading times, trip duration, and other functions which is downloaded via Datakey's electronic memory key to a master database.</p>
<p>--Chicaog newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
